window.products.push({"id":1048101,"name":"Picture Ornament for Christmas Tree 2022 - Heart Picture Frame Ornament for Tree - 2022 Picture Frame Gold Christmas Ornament - Set of 2-2022 Christma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fANNvkh8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHERISH THOSE MEMORIESCelebrate the special moments of 2022 with this gorgeous keepsake Christmas picture ornament set. The gleaming gold Christmas ornaments are beautifully designed by Klikel, to be displayed as your annual collectible. What a special way to reminisce 2022's fun times together and commemorate the year forever.ADD A TOUCH OF JOY AND SPARKLECelebrate the most wonderful time of the year with this gold photo frame ORNAMENT set. Remarkably elegant, The gleaming GOLD CHRISTMAS ORNAMENT 2022 set will add a double dose of love to your Christmas Tree. Boldly engraved 2022 to honor the passing year, these heart ornaments each hold a 1 1/2\" photo of a loved one. Included for your convenience is a traditional red holiday ribbon, sure to add chic flair to your tree dcor.THE PERFECT GIFT FOR SOMEONE SPECIALBring on the holiday cheer and present our Christmas Ornament 2022 photo frame as an unforgettable gift. Celebrate and share the miracles and magic of 2022 with this gorgeous memento. Displayed in an elegant red gift box, its all ready to surprise your loved ones.Features of the gold photo frame ornament 2022 Shiny Gold Color Engraved 2022 Holds one1 1/2\" photo Ornament Size 3\"How To Use the Heart Picture Frame Ornament 2022  Gift Yourself or Your Loved One Hang it on your Christmas tree Add it to your yearly collectionA WONDERFUL TRADITIONKeepsake ornaments are; For the stories you'll share year after year. For the memories you'll cherish forever. For the laughter and love and even the tears. For the traditions that bring you together, spanning generations of precious moments. Add a special ritual to this most wonderful time of the year! Gift or exchange this gold Christmas heart photo ornament 2022, a stunning keepsake to enjoy forever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fANNvkh8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Klikel","source_asin":"B0BHL4FNBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHL4FNBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHL4FNBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
