window.products.push({"id":1048135,"name":"Quilted Mirror Soap Dish for Bathroom (5.5\" x 4\" x 0.9\") – Decorative Dry Bar Holder- Durable Resin Design- Best Dishes for Sink/Bath/Shower/Bathtub D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BwqFQtWVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"GIVE YOUR BATHROOM A TOUCH OF UNBRIDLED ELEGANCE Touch of Sophistication Our Quilted mirror collection combines timeless style with contemporary patterns to create an upscale look that will turn your bathroom’s décor from simple to sensational. We’ve combined a truly unique quilted pattern with silver-like mirrored accents that exude an elegantly clean look that complements any décor. Perfectly sized, this set is great for any bathroom. It’s great for smaller spaces but still has the presence that fills even the grandest bathrooms. Start building your collection piece by piece and create bathroom décor worthy of a lifestyle magazine cover! Built to Last This isn’t just any bath set, it’s one of the most durable ones around. We’ve primarily used high-grade resin to craft the collection, known for its incredible lasting properties. The superior-quality resin doesn’t easily break like regular plastic, and has zero risk of corrosion unlike most metals. So even in the humid conditions of your bathroom, you’re guaranteed of a bath set that will remain in great  condition. A couple of years down the line and every piece will look as breathtaking as the day you got it! Here’s why you’ll love the quilted mirror collection: - Predominantly white styling that complements any décor. - Mirrored accents add an unmistakably sophisticated touch. - Made using high-grade resin to ensure maximum durability. - Perfectly-sized to fit even tight-spaced bathrooms. - Unique design makes it a great gift for both men and women. Count on the quilted mirror bath set collection to lavish your bathroom with uncompromising style and incredible quality. Click ‘Add to Cart’ now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BwqFQtWVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Scents","source_asin":"B01M9IQUYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M9IQUYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M9IQUYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
