window.products.push({"id":1048150,"name":"STORE INDYA Diwali décor Festival décor Diwali Decoration Diwali Gifts Diwali puja Deepawali décor Soapstone Candle Tea Light Holder Floral Design Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314tDo3q2UL._AC_.jpg","description":"Store Indya is a travel quest to unravel the forgotten hand crafted skills of India… Store Indya was something that was created as a result of family trips we took across India. While travelling, we not only saw different cultures in different parts of India, but we also realized each corner of India has its own secret. They all have their own unique art forms that’s known to only a very few in India, and almost unknown to the rest of the world. We discovered that these age-old glorious skills are getting suppressed. The artisans that we work with are trying to continue the dying legacy of their artwork. Each artwork handcrafted by them is an end product of their hard and meticulous work. Store Indya wants to revive these art forms and at the same time empower these skilled artists. We want to present different art forms and create a whole new product by itself that has never been created before. Overall, these products not only stand for aesthetics and traditions, but the designs on it also represent various socio-cultural issues that we want to talk about with the world and even encourage others to talk about it by gifting these handicrafts to one another. We want our products to not just sit quietly, looking pretty in a corner of your home, but in fact speak your mind. We at Store Indya believe in – “Design to empower.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314tDo3q2UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STORE INDYA","source_asin":"B00M81CLB0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M81CLB0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M81CLB0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1048151,"name":"Spice Jars with Labels,24 Pcs 4oz Glass Spice Jars with Bamboo Lid and 648 Waterproof Printed Labels,2 Salt and Pepper Grinder Set,Empty Spice Contain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JsVwl5GIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPLETE&VALUABLE SPICE JARS SET:4oz glass spice jars with 24 bamboo lids,24 shaker lid,648 PCS waterproof elegant reusable stickers,1 spice list, 2 Salt and Pepper Grinder,1 silicone collapsible funnel, 1 chalk and 1 tube brush. Making your kitchen look organized and tidy,beautiful bamboo lids and stylish square bottle design,no more clutter of your seasonings! PREMIUM QUALITY:Made of high quality non-toxic thicken glass with high-transparency visibility,100% BPA free,lead free,shatter-proof. And it allows you to find and see directly how much left inside the jars,save your time and making your cooking time more convenient and fun. 3 DIFFERENT KINDS OF WATERPROOF SPICE LABELS:The variety stickers includes 180pcs Pre-printed Black Round Stickers,180pcs Pre-printed White Square Sticker,180pcs Pre-printed Black Square Sticker& 108pcs 3 kinds of Blank Stickers. Printed on High-Quality Matt Waterproof Vinyl so you don't need to worry about getting your labels dirty you can just wipe them - but do not put them in the dishwasher.Blank sticker offers another options if you want to add the extra spices. 2 WAYS FUNCTIONAL SHAKR LIDS DESIGN:In order to fit most cooking needs on spices,it has a special 2-in-1 shaker lid for both powder and herbs with 2 kinds of sprinkle outlet.One is for powder ground spices and one is for herbs and grains.The fancy bamboo lids keeps your spice fresh and dry. MAKING YOUR KITCHEN ORGANIZED AND BEAUTIFUL:It's a great gift for housewarming,birthday or festival. The elegant square bottle design with a bamboo lids fits most kitchen decoration style.It gives you a convenient cooking time! Drop the unnecessary and messy package of seasonings and keep your seasonings organized without having to look for different seasonings or worry about tipping and falling off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JsVwl5GIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIVAIVE","source_asin":"B0C5X97DFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5X97DFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5X97DFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
