window.products.push({"id":1048173,"name":"Lin Da Absorbent Ceramic Coaster Set, Early Bird Christmas , Original Watercolor Design, Best Gift Idea, Funny and Positive, 6 Functional Round Coaste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715P9CRrMfL._AC_SL1171_.jpg","description":"Imagine a girl who is always in a good mood. She is smiling and cracking jokes. She enjoys good food, good wine and good company. Music, dance and travelling are her passion. She appreciates the moments for herself while having a cup of tea in one hand and a book in the other. She remains cheerful and positive even when nothing is going the way it should. Her name is Linda and she is a superwoman. Her smile is her superpower. Be her friend, join for a drink. A set of six absorbent ceramic coasters with the cork base is an ideal choice for anyone who wants to choose a quality and functional, as well as original and unique product on the market of identical or similar coasters. Each coaster includes a cute illustration with a positive inspirational message: 1. Failed? Keep smiling! 2. Stay foolish! Keep smiling! 3. Choose someone who makes you smile! 4. New Year’s resolutions. Keep smiling! 5. Overindulged? Enjoy and keep smiling! 6. Attitude is everything. Keep smiling! The set comes within a custom made gift packaging. A perfect match if you enjoy daily rituals (e.g. sipping your favourite drink in a cosy atmosphere) that improve your well-being.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715P9CRrMfL._AC_SL1171_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lin DA Coasters","source_asin":"B08GZ4SBMV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GZ4SBMV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GZ4SBMV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
