window.products.push({"id":1048177,"name":"Indoor Doormat Front Door Mat, Super Absorbent Entrance Door Rug, Non Slip Back Door Mats Indoor, Soft Entry Rugs Inside Machine Washable Lattice Door","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51B5wd+B24L._AC_.jpg","description":"MAIHOMETA IS ALWAYS CONSIDERATE OF WHAT YOU CARE MOST! MAIHOMETA super absorbent entrance mat indoor absorbs liquid in an instant, while the microfiber locks in the dirt and muck.Keep your visitors happy with a durable and multi-purpose non slip indoor welcome door mat.Specifications: Dimensions: 31\" inch Long x 19\" inch Wide, 0.45 inch in Thick Surface Material: 90% MicrofiberBacking material: TPR Thermoplastic Rubber We bet you will love our indoor door mat with following advantages: Our SUPER ABSORBENT DOORMAT is constructed of 100% high-quality microfiber, help maintain your floor by preventing muddy, rain, snow, slush and sleet footprints from ruining the look.All-natural heavy duty TPR rubber back is long lasting and more durable, will stop the door mat indoor slipping or rucking, it stays in place, eco friendly and safe for your family.The surface of the indoor floor mat is super soft, won’t sting your feet.Playful and neutral colors, suitable for any style spaces, you can simply use our welcome door mats as back door rugs, welcome mats, bathroom entry, snow rugs, or patio mats.Thin fun door mat: The thickness is 0.45 inches, low profile for most entryways, so doors won't get stuck by our front doormat. Warm Tips to Care Your Magic Mats: Please note it is not suitable for a wet or watery place.Machine washable, but better wash with hand to prolong life.To clean, simply vacuum and wash with mild detergent, using a mild soap and a damp cloth.For deeper cleaning, use a garden hose to rinse off outdoors.Never use bleach on the floor mat.Don’t wring.Don’t expose it to the sun. Let Love in, Keep Dirt Out! MAIHOMETA INDOOR Rug Will Do It for You!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51B5wd+B24L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAIHOMETA","source_asin":"B07TXJ2FKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TXJ2FKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TXJ2FKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
