window.products.push({"id":1048248,"name":"Electric Garlic Chopper Mini,250ML Wireless USB Rechargeable Portable Food Processor,Garlic Grinder Masher with Spoon for Chopping Onion,Ginger,Chili,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aUC+O3z5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧄【USB Rechargeable & Portable】Our rechargeable electric garlic chopper is USB rechargeable and can be used about 30 times after 3 hours of full charge. 250ML mini food processor is not only space saving but also very portable that can satisfy the needs of camping, traveling and other outdoor activities. 🧅[One key Operation & Efficient】The electric food chopper processor is one touch control with high performance motor and ultra-sharp 304 stainless steel blades,just put food or ingredients into the chopper,lock the lid and press the power switch for cutting the food,only needs 20s can automatic and evenly mince/blend a wide variety of foods.Low Consumption, low noise, high efficiency,it is a small kitchen appliances worth of your choice. 🌶【Safety Design & Health】When using the vegetable chopper to cut food, please make sure you have aligned the body of the garlic masher with the bowl to ensure your safety during use.The onion chopper's food contact parts are adopt food grade materials that is harmless to your family.The presence of a transparent baffle prevents scratches, splashes and flavours from escaping. 🥕【Waterproof Design for Easy Cleaning】Our mini onion chopper adopt waterproof design,the blender cup and blade are detachable, no stain residue,making cleaning and assemble are simply,just rinse and dry. 🍅【Useful Kitchen gadgets】Want to chop up your food/fruit easily? No problem, our mini electric garlic masher is a very necessary kitchen helper for you. Whether you want to chop onions, garlic, peppers, fruits, meat and more, our food processor will help you out quickly. Please note that for some harder foods or fruits, we recommend that you preheat or boil them first when using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aUC+O3z5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HTE","source_asin":"B0BS88X71K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS88X71K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS88X71K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1048249,"name":"Rae Dunn EGGCITED Mug Yellow inside - Ceramic - Easter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uJL4O6PkL._AC_.jpg","description":"Rae Dunn is a California native and resides in the San Francisco, Bay Area. Rae's inspritaion comes from the earth, and she finds beauty in simple shapes, natural forms and found objects. Her utilitarian approach to designing ceramics is strongly based on the Japenese aeshetic of Wabi Sabi ; the beauty of things imperfect, impermanent, and incomplete. Each mug is handcrafted and hand-painted so each mug is unique and can have slight imperfections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uJL4O6PkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAE DUNN BY MAGENTA","source_asin":"B08W22K9TZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W22K9TZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W22K9TZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1048250,"name":"Nuwave Flex Precision Induction Cooktop, Portable, Large 6.5” Heating Coil, 10.25” Shatter-Proof Ceramic Glass, 3 Watt Settings, 4Qt Induction-Ready H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614Y+4ac3aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE ADJUSTMENTS ON-THE-FLY – Want hotter temperature or need to cook it longer? No problem. Simply adjust on-the-fly any time. No need to start over. Flex’s intuitive digital controls are easy to operate, and the response is immediate. 45 PRE-PROGRAMMED TEMPS - Select from the 6 convenient preset temperature settings or fine tune your own temperature from 100°F to 500°F in 10°F increments. You can also add or deduct cooking time at any time. SHATTER-PROOF CERAMIC GLASS – The heating surface is heavy-duty shatter-proof ceramic glass. It was rigorously tested to withstand intense heat without shattering. It is one of the safest cooktops on the market. FAST & EFFICIENT – Flex heats the pot directly transferring 85%~90% of its electro-magnetic energy to heat energy! Traditional stovetops only convert about 30% of their heat for cooking. Flex cooks faster; saves energy; and is safer than any stovetop. SAFETY BUILT-IN – Even if you forget, Flex will shut off automatically when the set cook time is completed. When the cookware is removed from the cooktop, Flex will not start. There are no hot coils or open flames reducing the risk of burns and fire. PERFECT FOR DORMS & RV’S – Flex is light-weight and portable. It performs flawlessly in RV’s, dorms, campsites, and smaller apartments. Its 3 wattage settings of 600, 900 & 1300 watts are designed to work well anywhere even when the power is limited. PROGRAMMABLE FUNCTIONS – With Flex, you can sear, boil, simmer, fry, deep fry, sauté, slow cook, melt, or simply re-heat or keep warm. The applications are endless. Now it’s easy to prepare healthy, great tasting meals with a touch of a button. SUPERIOR TECHNOLOGY - The slim design of Flex and its patented insulation technology brings the induction heating coils closer to your cookware than the competition for faster & even heating, ensuring no hot or cold spots for optimal cooking experience. CHEF INSPIRED FEATURES & FUNCTIONS – Every feature and function of Flex are created and rigorously tested by highly trained NUWAVE chefs and RD team. We obsessed over every detail in pursuit of optimal performance and durability. 4QT DURALON BLUE CERAMIC FRYING PAN INCLUDED – Ultra-nonstick healthy ceramic, induction-ready frying pan is non-toxic, lid included, PTFE & PFOA free, oven safe, and compatible with all cooktops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614Y+4ac3aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B00Q5N1XDO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q5N1XDO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Q5N1XDO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
