window.products.push({"id":1048468,"name":"Egg Slicer, Egg Slicer for Hard Boiled Eggs Dishwasher Safe, Stainless Steel Wire, with Anti-slip Groove, 2 Slicing Styles, Suitable for Egg Strawberr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61otcKUs+nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Good Helper of Kitchen Have you ever cut your fingers while slicing your eggs? If you eat hard-boiled eggs frequently, purchasing an egg slicer could be a wise decision. Here come with you the convenient egg slicer. This multi-purpose egg slicer is not only for hard-boiled eggs but also for soft fruits like strawberry, banana and kiwi, etc. Slice/Wedge Mode With this hard boiled egg slicer, you would achieve ideal slices or wedges in only a few seconds. Choice 1 Turn over the first layer and press, you could have 5mm ideal oblong or round slices. Choice 2 Turn over the second layer and press, you could have 6 wedges. Tip: Slice the egg when it is cooled and the egg slices will look better. Clean Up Easily This boiled egg cutter measures 4.5×3.75×1.5 inch and weighs 7.76 ounces, small and portable. Two-layer frames are polished, durable and easy to clean. After slicing, just rinse it with water or put it in the dishwasher. Material This egg cutter is made of high-quality 304 stainless steel and ABS. Compared with plastic ones, you don’t have to worry about rusting, bending or cracking. The boiled egg slicer has an egg-shaped design and groove support base, thus adding extra stability while standing on a countertop. Features Are you tired of wasting time cutting eggs or fruits piece by piece? Fed up with those uneven and mushy egg slices you make using a knife? Thin stainless steel food grade wires of the egg slicer for hard boiled eggs works as well as knives. Press the frame and then cut the egg precisely and fast. You will never waste time on troublesome cutting eggs with a knife piece by piece or worry about hurting fingers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61otcKUs+nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Senvasfa","source_asin":"B08TX3V797","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TX3V797","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TX3V797","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
