window.products.push({"id":1048549,"name":"AOTENG STAR Shoe Box Organizer Stackable Plastic Shoe Storage Box Side &Front Drop Open Door Sneaker Cases Heavy Duty Shoe Container Organizer for Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kgpLPAHkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Two Ways To Display】According to your preference, this shoe box can show your shoes from all sides. It can open the door either front or side. The light transmittance of the shoe box is better, which can ensure the best display of the shoes on the basis of making it easy for you to take the shoes. Strong magnet adsorption saves you from worrying about the door falling off. 【Functional And Attractive Shoe Storage Ideas】This grey shoe box is specifically designed to hold shoes of almost every size. Dimensions are 14″L x 11″W x 8.7″H, with inside dimensions 13.0″L x 10.5″W x 6.0″H. It’s a great fit for most men’s shoes up to US size 13. There’s still a lot of space in the sneaker containers after you place the pair.When you get this plastic shoe box, you can put all your shoes that will range from sneakers, officials, and other styles depending on their size. 【Premium Shoe Box Double Your Storage Space!】Whether you're looking for creative ways to organize shoes or simply trying to maximize your storage space, our clear boxes for shoes will meet your’s need. The simplicity of the design makes it easy to stack the sneaker boxes in a secure way for space saving.So, you can build a nice rack and maximize the storage potential of your home.They can be placed under a clothing rack, in the hallway as a giant shoe cabinet or as a long line under your bed. 【Heavy Duty Organizers,Reinforced Frame】The materials used for this clear shoe containers are premium PP and ABS (PP in shoe storage boxes and ABS in the frames).It is really sturdy and durable. Despite the sturdiness, it is still light-weight.It is easy to assemble and the reinforced frame will give this box some extra stability.After you get this storage shoe box, you will not need to install any drawers or cabinets. You will also use them to store cosmetics, books, hats, bags and kids toys. 【Sleek & Stylish Display,Best After-Sale Service】Have your shoes organized doesn’t mean to ruin the whole aesthetics of your house. With it’s stylish design, these shoe cases will make your home looks tidier and comfortable. It contains ventilation system that makes the shoes safe from dust, dirt, moisture and odor.Your pair will stay in the same good condition as when you bought them. If any shoe box are found to be defective, please feel free to contact us. We will be there at your service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kgpLPAHkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOTENG STAR","source_asin":"B09D9J972K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D9J972K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D9J972K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
