window.products.push({"id":1048558,"name":"LARGE BLUE AGATE SLAB 4-5 INCH Geode Slice with Stand Crystal Mineral Gemstone Rock Gem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9199o3AHUUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You'll Be Receiving 1 Large \"Blue\" Agate Slice/Slab. It's been artificially color enhanced (dyed) to help accent it's beauty. It's approximately 4-5 inches at it's widest point and about 1/4 inch thick. The one shown is an example only. You'll get one similar as each stone slice is unique and will have natural variations (see the additional images).  Your purchase will also include an acrylic display stand.We'll also include a handy stone Identification Chart. It shows the names and pictures of 50 common stones. On the backside of the chart are the stones names shown in 5 different languages (English, German, French, Italian and Spanish). It's printed on a heavy card stock and makes a nice addition or tool in assisting you with whatever kind of stone collection you might have. Another Rockin' Product Offered By Blue Water Crystals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9199o3AHUUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Water Crystals","source_asin":"B00GYFV18K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GYFV18K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GYFV18K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1048559,"name":"DOFASAYI String Lights with Clips - 33Ft 100 Led Photo Clip String Light with Battery Operated String Lights with 50 Clear Clips for Hanging Pictures,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZFEhSu9XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YOUR ROMANCE AND FINE: We always have endless things to say to the one we love. Always want to share the best things with him or her. But we always remember those beautiful moments forever. A romantic trip, a warm birthday party. Use these fairy-tale photo clip lights to create the beautiful moments you guard. Let these warm lights bring you warmth and romance. The transparent and cute clip hangs your photos to string together all your good memories. LENGTHEN WITHOUT PRICE INCREASE:17 feet longer than other Photo Clip String Lights plus 50 led lights100 LED String Lights total length 33Ft, 10cm between 2 blubs. (Package includes 50 clear clips) It allows you to free adjustment any sizes on the led string lights for picture, any anyway you want! Upgraded with an on and off button,A newly added on and off switch means you will not have to deal with having to plug and unplug power cords. YOU CAN ALSO be a GREAT CREATOR:DOFASAYI's fairy-tale lights are light and can be easily moved to any place you like.They can be easily twisted and wrapped around decorations and furniture.It is not only an ideal light string for the bedroom,indoor light string decoration without photo pins.Make your own unique lighting decoration, for example, put it in a jar or use it in the photo display of the bedroom, wedding, Christmas or birthday party! All your beauty and romance stem from your creation. ENERGY SAVING AND SAFETY:The premium quality LED light string is efficient and cost effective. The sparkle lights with their mini LED lights will light up even the darkest corners, creating a magical effect.The light string will not heat up even after 14 hours of continuous working.easy to install and safe for children, convenient to prepare indoor or outdoor decoration. No need to worry about your display being near an outlet or power source. NO-RISK, HIGH RETURN:we ensure your 100% satisfied with the product and service proud. If you are not satisfied with the purchase experience. please don't hesitate to contact DOFASAYI, we'll get it resolved as soon as we can. Until you are satisfied. If you have any questions, please email us via Amazon.We will replace your item or give you a 100% refund. With such a service, you don't need to worry more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZFEhSu9XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOFASAYI","source_asin":"B07Y5W3JHB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y5W3JHB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y5W3JHB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
