window.products.push({"id":1048659,"name":"Zeroway 5 Pairs Reusable Fiberglass Chopsticks Dishwasher Safe with Gift Case Chopstick Set for Household Restaurant - Golden flower","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vwMGJgxgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Description: Why do you choose our Chopsticks? 1. Our chopsticks are made of PPS, PET and glass fiber, they have no peculiar smell, high-temperature resistance, corrosion resistance, no moldy, and are not easy to deform, safe and reliable   2. These reusable chopsticks with no paint or coating, no risk of eating chemicals, also easy to clean, just stay clear and clean like new having them washed in dishwasher everyday   3. These Chinese chopsticks are suitable for home, hotel, restaurant, travel, also can be used as hairpin, ideal for any Asian-style dinner party, Sushi Night, Noodle soup, Korean BBQ, etc. Specification(approx): Material: PPS, PET, glass fiber polymer material  Length：243mm/9.56 inch  Weight : 36g  One Set: 5 pairs  Packaging: Luxury gift case How to use the Chopsticks: 1. Hold your hand as though you are going to shake hands with someone  2. Put the first chopstick under your thumb, resting it on the palm  3. Hold the second chopstick between your thumb and forefinger  4. Bend your ring finger and little finger, and tuck the ring finger under the lower chopstick  5. Put your middle finger under the top chopstick  6. Move the top chopstick up and down to grip food Package Included 1* Chopsticks Set","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vwMGJgxgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zeroway","source_asin":"B07VH425GP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VH425GP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VH425GP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
