window.products.push({"id":1048718,"name":"Big Betty - Pinot Protector Wine Bottle Stopper - Air-Tight, No Leak, Food Grade Nitrile - Red (6 Count)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Dn-Hu4RRL._AC_.jpg","description":"A Rubber for Your Wine When that bottle is just too much, make the responsible choice and slip on a Pinot Protector. These bottle condoms act like a traditional wine stopper or cork, sealing your bottle to prevent “accidents” and preserve quality until you’re ready to enjoy it again. These wine accessories are a great novelty gift for men and women, sure to elicit a snort, chuckle, and blush from the assembled crowd. Spice up your next White Elephant Christmas gift exchange or wedding with a box of Pinot Protectors. Unlike their look alikes, Pinot Protectors are reusable. Simply rinse with warm water and allow to air dry. Also unlike their look alikes, Pinot Protectors are intended ONLY for bottles; don’t get any funny ideas. Besides, they’re sized to fit the rather small neck of a wine bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Dn-Hu4RRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Betty","source_asin":"B0C799FX25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C799FX25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C799FX25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
