window.products.push({"id":1048800,"name":"Mini Food Bag Heat Sealer Handheld, Portable Handheld Sealing, Household Snack Chips Bag Sealing Machine (Mint)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnlFUNBIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The portable mini sealing household machine can efficiently and safely seal food bags and snack bags. Mini heat sealing machine makes your life more convenient and faster. Plastic bag sealer is widely used in food bags, candy bags, potato chips bags, aluminum foil bags, potato chips bags, PVC bags, and other plastic bags. This portable mini sealing machine is ideal for home, kitchen, office for travel. Important reminder:  1. Do not use thin bags for heat sealing, not suitable for cling film bags, cellophane bags. 2. Great for a snack bag, candy bag, potato chips bag, kraft paper bag, aluminum foil bag, PVC plastic bag. 3. The preheating time of the sealing is 30 seconds. Please control the sealing time according to the thickness of the packaging bag to avoid the temperature being too high and scalding the packaging bag. 4. After turning on the power, do not touch the wavy heating plate. 5. Be careful to avoid burns.  6. Do not heat for a long time.  7. Unplug the power plug and turn off the power button when not in use to avoid burning the heat sealer. Specifications  Item: Portable mini sealing household machine  Material: ABS  Color: As the picture shows Packing size: 22 x 6.2 x 3.1cm/ 8.66 × 2.44 ×1.22 inch  Weight: 4.7 ounces  Application: Food bag, candy bag, potato chips bag, aluminum foil bag, potato chips bag, PVC bag, and other plastic bags.  Package includes:  1 × Heat sealing machine (including 40.5-inch power cord) 1 × User manual, 1 × Plastic storage box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnlFUNBIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lishitong","source_asin":"B088NGCFSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088NGCFSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088NGCFSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
