window.products.push({"id":1048953,"name":"Newest 2022 Projector Alarm Clock for Bedroom Ceiling, Projection Digital Clock Radio with USB Charger Ports, Dual Alarms, Snooze Model, 4 Dimmer, 7.3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BKkdPBw0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥 【180° Projector Alarm Clock】- Wonderful clock for your bedroom.180° adjustable projector (-90° to 90°), 7.3''ultra-large LED display projection alarm clock, you can easily read the time on ceiling while lying in bed. And our digital alarm clock equipped with a high sensitivity sensor which can adjust the display brightness, it will not disturb you or your kids sleeping.Note: Long press the \"project\" key to use the projection view up and down 180°. 🔥【Adjustable Volume &15 FM Radios with Sleep Time 】-The 15 FM Radios loud alarm clock special designed loud alarm clock for heavy sleepers adjustable 15 levels volume provide louder and stronger alarm volume, easy to wake you up. The sleep timer function (5-90 minutes) will turn off after the specific time you set.The clock has the functions of automatically searching, locking, storing stations, storage unlimited number of stations, simple and convenient. 🔥【Dual Alarms with Snooze Function】- Our loud electronic digital ceiling clock projector for bedroom has two separate alarms design which could wake you and your companion up at different alarm time setting, or double waking-up service for you only. Press the big SNOOZE button at the top to get extra precious 6 minutes sleep till next loop of the alarm. 🔥【USB Charging Port & Memory Function】- With 5V USB output interface allow you to charge cellphone,tablets and other electronics devices simultaneously when you charge the LED alarm clock. Backup Memory battery(included) can remain clock time working normally and remember original time /alarm/radio/snooze settings, no need to reset while in case of power failure.NOTE: the usb charger not included, please make sure you have the USB adapter. 🔥【Easy to Operate & Wide Application】- Our LED digital alarm clock has its unique designed 12/24H& DST button.With the intuitive setting buttons, the alarm clock for heavy clock sleeper is easy to use even for kids or elders.Updated features such as vibration, dual alarm, dimmer, USB charging port and modern design, the digital alarm clock can be as a perfect gift for your family, friends, kids. 🔥【 Lifetime Warranty- 365 Days REFUND 】- Allows you to try our alarm clock for one full year.We guarantee 100% free lifetime warranty. We believe that you deserve the best. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us via Amazon if you have any problem with our clock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BKkdPBw0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09DCMPL2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1048953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DCMPL2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DCMPL2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
